@FirearmStudio.WebApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5146

# Supabase access token (omit the "Bearer " prefix here; it's added below).
@token = PASTE_SUPABASE_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE

### Unauthenticated -> 401
GET {{FirearmStudio.WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/me
Accept: application/json

### Authenticated -> 200 { id, email, roles }
GET {{FirearmStudio.WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/me
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Admin-only -> 200 if token has the "admin" role, else 403
GET {{FirearmStudio.WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/me/admin-check
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
